{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","克鲁格"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名勇猛的战士，他能破坏敌人的护甲，然后将其征服。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这是最棒的选择"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","You just made the best choice!"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","无可匹敌的秘诀就是不断变强"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","The secret to being invincible is to always get stronger."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","畏惧吧！粉碎吧！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Taste! My! Axe!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","我还没有输……"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","一切抵抗都不堪一击"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","All resistance crumbles!"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","利斧将斩下最强者的头颅。"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_i18n/en","Hah, a keen axe will take the head of even the strongest warrior."],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","哼，要打吗？那可得好好打磨了。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","哦，还有这个，味儿不错。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","哼，别想钻空子，我没有死角。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","感谢馈赠，这对我意义非凡。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","我会好好使用的。"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","筋骨有点生锈啊……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","斧头也要好好磨一下了"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","要不要来个苹果？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","装饰应该更狂野些！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","今夜就尽情喝个痛快！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","哈！真热闹，我喜欢！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","来吧，伙计们，闹起来！"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","克鲁格花了很久才习惯视野不全的感觉，为了不让敌人钻空子，在那段时间他出招比之前更加狠戾了。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","绝大多数人不知道，克鲁格年轻时曾试图竞争族长，但惨败给了兄长。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","据说，有时克鲁格醒来时会戴错眼罩的方向，然后误以为自己变成了全盲。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","克鲁格吃任何食物都不会切开，如果实在太大块，他会考虑撕开。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","克鲁格的衣着颜色不利于隐蔽，他不畏惧，甚至欢迎人来挑战和寻仇。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","克鲁格的斧刃上常出现豁口，他是武器商人的常客。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","克鲁格对于强弱有自己的判断，因为这与黑嚎传统观念相悖，所以他从不说出来。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","像每一个蛮血那样，克鲁格以战斗为荣，包括那些因为对手过于强大而惨败的战斗。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","克鲁格是一场保卫氏族荣誉的战斗中失去了一只眼睛，从此之后他性格大变。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","克鲁格曾经挑战过布鲁特斯，二人过了十几招后，布鲁特斯便战胜了他。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","筋骨有点生锈啊……"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415094.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","克鲁格"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","要不要来个苹果？"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415095.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","克鲁格"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","装饰应该更狂野些！"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415403.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","克鲁格"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","今夜就尽情喝个痛快！"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415404.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","克鲁格"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","哈！真热闹，我喜欢！"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415575.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","克鲁格"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","来吧，伙计们，闹起来！"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415576.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","克鲁格"]]}